WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:05.682
Today’s task: build 3x + 2 − x − 5, then simplify it.

2
00:00:05.682 --> 00:00:15.395
Tap a tile in the palette to put it on the board. The total keeps count.

3
00:00:15.395 --> 00:00:19.379
For −x, add an x. Hold it, or right-click it, for its wheel.

4
00:00:19.379 --> 00:00:22.914
Flip turns a tile into its opposite.

5
00:00:22.914 --> 00:00:25.456
Drag the −x under an x to make a zero pair.

6
00:00:25.456 --> 00:00:27.817
Drag on empty board space to select several tiles.

7
00:00:27.817 --> 00:00:31.191
Delete takes the zero pairs away.

8
00:00:31.191 --> 00:00:35.108
Select the rest the same way. Drag one, and they all move.

9
00:00:35.108 --> 00:00:38.093
What is left is the simplest form: 2x − 3.

10
00:00:38.093 --> 00:00:46.634
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
